# What is gleaning? Millet's The Gleaners
tags: ["art history","gleaning poverty","millet realism","social class painting","19th century france","biblical charity"]
teaches: ["art-history/social-class-in-painting","concepts/gleaning","history/french-revolution-context","methods/composition-foreground-emphasis"]
